@startuml seq-b-main
title Вариант B. Основной сценарий на Temporal: push доставлен
autonumber
participant "Платёжный\nсервис" as P
participant "Ingest API" as API
participant "Temporal\nCluster" as T
participant "DeliveryWorkflow\n(worker)" as W
participant "Activity\nworkers" as A
participant "FCM / APNs" as FCM
participant "Мобильное\nприложение" as App
participant "Receipt\nGateway" as G

P -> API : SendNotification(source, event_id, class, user_id)
API -> T : StartWorkflow(id="payments:tx-42",\nreuse=RejectDuplicate)
T --> API : run_id (или WorkflowExecutionAlreadyStarted -> дубль)
API --> P : 202 Accepted {notification_id}
T -> W : workflow task
W -> T : ExecuteActivity(GetPreferences)
T -> A : activity task
A --> T : plan=[PUSH, SMS, EMAIL]
T -> W : result
W -> T : ExecuteActivity(SendPush, attempt=1)
T -> A : activity task
A -> FCM : send(collapse_id=notification_id)
FCM --> A : 200
A --> T : completed
W -> T : await Signal("delivered") с таймером 10 с
FCM -> App : push
App -> G : POST /acks
G -> T : SignalWorkflow("payments:tx-42", delivered{attempt=1})
T -> W : signal
W -> T : CompleteWorkflow(DELIVERED via PUSH)
note over T : Каждый шаг записывается в историю (Cassandra):\n~12–15 событий на уведомление
@enduml
